      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAKE SOME NOISE (1) is a talented dog who is a winner of 12 races and filled a minor placing latest when second at Angle Park (20.28). Has never been out of the money in six starts this course and distance. Rates highly and will give a great sight. DOLLY'S MY MUM (4) is a quick dog who thrives over the short dashes. Was too tough when scoring last time over 305m at Mt Gambier in a Grade 5 (17.36). Has a strong winning record here at the trip including two wins. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. BINNAWAY MIRAGE (8) was well supported last start but didn't deliver when fifth (23.12), beaten 5.5 lengths. Was in the money the start prior. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. REALITY IS (2) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
